# Build context for infra/review/Dockerfile.web (BuildKit picks
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore up automatically).
#
# The context is the repository root, and this image needs what the api image
# excludes on purpose: package.json, package-lock.json, apps/web/ and packages/.
# Everything below is host state or another image's input: it must not be tarred
# into the context, and .env* must never be (scripts/review/deploy.sh writes real
# credentials into $HOME/evidgate-review/.env.review, and a context that carried a
# copy would hand them to the builder).
.git
.github
.spectral.yaml
artifacts
TestResults
docs
plans
tests
fixtures/*
!fixtures/web-api
src
contracts
migrations
infra/docker
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.user
**/*.md
.DS_Store
.env*
.local
.husky
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
